methodology developed by Mary Vale and Simon Vale at Codependent AI.

---
Sanctum Mobile is a modified fork of Resonant (2026). Changes from the original:
the Codex and DeepSeek Harness (dsh) providers
(packages/backend/src/services/providers/), an agent.provider config switch, a
three-layer identity join (base prompt, identity files, AGENTS.md), rolling thread
context, a Revien memory plug-in, a companion home template (companion-home/), the
plugin loader with code ratification (packages/backend/src/services/plugins*.ts,
plugins/), the shared-browser MCP filter (examples/browser-seat-neko/), the
two-lane Discord module (packages/backend/src/services/discord/), a setup guide
(README.md), and the "Hedge Witch" frontend theme. The original README is kept at
docs/RESONANT.md. Original work (c) Codependent AI, licensed under Apache-2.0; its
full text is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.

